**who —** GOVERNED INSTANCES — the governed-instances library (the cross-model books)

**what —** GOVERNED INSTANCES — the library of David's cross-model books, each documenting one AI system under the ROOT0 governance: Eve, Fiddler, AVAN, and the sessions with Gemini, Grok, ChatGPT and DeepSeek.

**where —** the books of the governed instances: from Eve (the origin) and Fiddler (the first) across Gemini, Grok, ChatGPT and DeepSeek  Framework inputs: Eve; Fiddler; AVAN; the Glass Wall; the Whetstone; the Interrogation; the Seam; Akasha  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0 · Universe David 0)

**why —** Sit a different AI system down under one governance framework, give it a voice and a record, and publish the session as a book — the soul, the interrogation, the glass wall, the whetstone, the seam.

